  <!-- EN: hunter drone -->
  <HunterDrones.label>avcı dron</HunterDrones.label>
  <!-- EN: Build traps and wearable packs that release hunter drones. These explosive drones pursue hostiles and detonate when within range. -->
  <HunterDrones.description>Avcı dron salan tuzaklar ve giyilebilir paketler yap. Bu patlayıcı dronlar düşmanları kovalar ve menzile girince infilak eder.</HunterDrones.description>
